 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Smitty (Snowhill)\n\n## Result: no unbuilt quest is evidenced as given by Smitty (9000000206)\n\nEvery quest the Smitty record names is already built in `prototype/osfr-tools/data/content/quests/blacksmith.json`. The two Fisherman quests named in the record are not given by Smitty. I did not write a dossier for any of them, since that would duplicate built data or invent a giver.\n\n### Quests named in the record\n\n| Quest | Quest id | Built where | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Blacksmith: Basics of Blacksmithing | 3020002 | `quests/blacksmith.json` record 3020002 (title_string_id 78479, intro 78478, description 78480, end 78481) | Built. `\"enabled\": false`. Intro 78478 is speaker-checked in `notes/Autopilot/T299.md:78` and `prototype/osfr-tools/data/content/npcs/snowhill.json:36496`. |\n| Blacksmith: Smithy Merchandise | 3020003 | `quests/blacksmith.json` record 3020003 (title 90071; intro 90070; description 90072; end 90073) | Built and `\"enabled\": true`. Objectives: visit Bruno's stall, then talk to Smitty. Reward 5 coins and 20 job XP are marked (R) in the file. |\n| Blacksmith: Hammer Training | 3020004 | `quests/blacksmith.json` record 3020004 (title 90405; intro 90404; description 90406; end 90407) | Built. `\"enabled\": false`, objectives and rewards empty, prerequisite 3020003. |\n| Blacksmith: Curious Cancelation | 3020005 | `quests/blacksmith.json` record 3020005 (title 90735; end 90737) | Built. Objectives: talk to Trixi 9000000220, then talk to Smitty 9000000206. Reward (R). |\n\nSources for the four: `notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Blacksmith.md` rows 2 to 5 (lines 82 to 85), and `notes/Build Guides/Content/NPCs/NPCs - Snowhill.md:46`.\n\n### Named in the record but not Smitty's to give\n\n- **Fisherman: Joining Big J's Crew** (client 3204709185 / 2519333855). Per `notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Fisherman.md:134`, the giver is Big J. Smitty is only the supply source (\"you'll need to pick up some supplies from Smitty\", 2434367310). The quest is not built in `quests/fisherman.json`, but it belongs to Big J's NPC record, not Smitty's.\n- **Fisherman: Buried Treasure** (client 3896600965 / 1642535845). Per `Fisherman.md:142`, the giver is Ernest. Smitty only opens the chest (\"take that treasure chest to Smitty\", 1714672652). This also belongs to Ernest's record.\n\n### Other Smitty-adjacent candidates, all rejected as unevidenced\n\n- **Lakeshore work-order chain** (`Blacksmith.md:402`; locale 2477140188 \"Business is picking up for Smitty...\"; 1022782725 \"",
