 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Dominic (Briarwood)\n\n# Dominic (npc 9000000074, name string 407094, Briarwood dig site)\n\n## Already built (skipped, with problems noticed)\n- **Card Duelist: A Card Dueling Rumor** (title 407008). Built as quest 3040029 in `quests/card_duelist.json:1430-1479`. Poe Tatters sends the player here, so Dominic is not its giver. The built giver is 9000000518, which is unresolved in `npcs_unresolved.json:4360`.\n- **Card Duelist: Dominic's New Card** (title 407029). Built as 3040030 in `card_duelist.json:1480-1529`, giver 9000000074. Its intro 407028 (\"go challenge Dominic… Tell him to use that new card he got\") is Esther's line. `notes/Autopilot/T317.md:92-96` already flags this speaker mismatch.\n- **Card Duelist: Break Time** (title 413775). Built as 3040031 in `card_duelist.json:1530-1575`, giver 9000000074. Its intro 413774, desc 413776 and end 413777 are the Esther/Dominic wallet-and-Ambrose dialogue (\"Wellington sure makes friends fast… He's investigating a wallet…\", \"A bright crayon?…\"), not Break Time. The Break Time text is more likely the 407016 / 407017 pair, which the guide quotes (`notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Card Duelist.md:123`). Not changed here.\n\n## Quest 1 (unbuilt): Card Duelist: Gifted Cards\n- **Title:** 413779 \"Card Duelist: Gifted Cards\".\n- **Giver:** Dominic, inferred from the speaker of the lines below (9000000074, name 407094). The guide has no giver (`Card Duelist.md:185`, row 64, \"unknown\").\n- **Intro (Dominic, T-1 = 413778):** \"So I started talking to Ambrose, and he must've noticed my deck of cards. He gave me a bunch of new ones to try out! I can't wait to see how they do! Are you up for a few card games?\"\n- **Description (T+1 = 413780):** \"Dominic in Briarwood wants to play a few card games with you so he can try out his new cards.\"\n- **End (T+2 = 413781):** \"You're a flippin' cardie genius! Man, I need to learn how to play like you. Shh... Did Esther look this way? I don't want her to catch me playing again.\"\n- **Steps (inferred):** talk to Dominic at the Briarwood dig site, then play card games with him. No deck or count is evidenced for this quest.\n- **Prerequisites (R):** Dominic's New Card (3040030), Ambrose's cards are the \"new ones\". The guide only says \"unknown\" for the prerequisite.\n- **Rewards:** unknown. None evidenced.\n- **Evidence:** locale 413778–413781 (the quest-line block, ids in order). Title 413779 also appears in the client locale dumps (`refs`: `opening-*/locale/en_us_data.dat`, \"423274255 ugdt / 7",
