rwood wants to play another game of cards with you. Then, he should really get back to work!\" and 413773 \"I need to switch up these cards. You're going to run this dig dry!… Can you talk to Esther for me in the meantime?\". Which of these is the offer and which are objectives is not evidenced.\n- **Steps, in order from the text:**\n  1. Talk to Esther, who says Dominic is investigating a wallet found after the attempted robbery (413774).\n  2. Return to Esther once Dominic is back. Esther says: \"Ah, Dominic's back. I had him investigate the own",
