 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Ambrose Worcester (Greenwood Forest)\n\n## Ambrose Worcester (npc 9000000005, locale 70339): unbuilt quests\n\nAlready built, so skipped: **Card Duelist: Something Precious** (3040037, title 413791) and **Card Duelist: Scattered Artifacts** (3040038, title 413795), both in `quests/card_duelist.json` (lines 1808, 1854). Also built, but **not** Ambrose's: **Card Duelist: Confronting Ambrose** (3040035, title 413787) has giver 9000000082 (Esther), not Ambrose (`card_duelist.json:1716-1718`). The record's `quests_given_text` wrongly lists it as an Ambrose quest.\n\nThe three wiki questline quests below are unbuilt (no hit for their title ids, locale ids or description hashes in `prototype/osfr-tools/data`). They run in this order: Friendly Competition, then Turning the Tables, then Digging for Glory. The wiki page lists them in that order (`refs:freerealms-wiki/wikitext/3802-50105-5c9c807e7c3d.wiki` lines 13-17). The Ambrose-voiced text supports the order: \"more artifacts\" (71547) and \"keep at it\" (71550) follow the earlier steps.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Friendly Competition\n- **Title:** locale **70383** \"Friendly Competition\". Hashes: ucdt 1709971177 (`refs:opening-native-lobby-20261009T163603Z/locale/en_us_data.dat:45157`), ugdt 1231488612 (line 32622).\n- **Offer (intro, precedes title by ID pattern):** **70382** \"Can you believe Wellington was awarded an honorary title? &quot;Sir Wellington&quot; - ha! I'm twice the archeologist he is! He just got lucky.<BR><BR>Help me <font color='#D9781A'>dig up some artifacts</font> and I'll reward you. I need to make a great find and put Wellington in his place!\"\n- **Description:** **70384** \"Ambrose needs some help if he's going to be able to compete with his arch rival Sir Wellington.\" (hash 3103689650, `locale` ucdt line 81951)\n- **Steps:**\n  1. Talk to Ambrose Worcester (9000000005) at Ambrose's Dig Site (locale 70351). Accept.\n  2. Dig up artifacts at the dig site. The only evidenced activity is the \"Ambrose's Dig\" match-3 minigame: \"Complete the 'Ambrose's Dig' minigame\" (1230652097, ucdt line 32602). Whether it is this quest's objective is **inferred**; no objective string names it.\n  3. Return to Ambrose. Completion line **70385**: \"Thanks for your help. A few more successful finds such as these and soon everyone will forget about Wellington!\"\n- **Prerequisites:** none evidenced. Order after Ambrose's earlier quests is inferred from the wiki list.\n- **Rewards:** (R) — 70382 says \"I'll reward you\", no item, coin or XP",
