 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Madam Zelda (Blackspore Swamp)\n\n# Madam Zelda (npc 9000000136, Blackspore Swamp): unbuilt quests\n\n## Already built (not re-dossiered)\nMadam Zelda's `quest_ids_given` (3040053, 3040054, 3040055, 3040056, 3040057, 3040058, 3040063) are all already in `repo:prototype/osfr-tools/data/content/quests/card_duelist.json` with `giver_npc_id: 9000000136` (lines 2569, 2619, 2669, 2719, 2773, 2823, 3089). These are the seven Card Duelist records: Zelda's Warning, Heart of Darkness, Slow and Steady, Stinky Feet, Meet the Boss, The Realmkeepers Are Missing!, Return from the Rumbledome. 3040059–3040062 are the Rumbledome duel quests (Jort, Milo, Yucca, Ironteeth), not Zelda's.\n\nThe unbuilt Zelda quests are **A Dark Future** (built first, fully evidenced) and **Being Prepared (Team Vampire)** (title only). Being Prepared (Team Werewolf) has no client title I could find.\n\n---\n\n## 1. A Dark Future (unbuilt; no numeric quest id)\n\n- **Title:** locale **432195**: \"A Dark Future\". Name hashes 1417037571 (ucdt) / 2253578615 (ugdt) per the guides and `locale/en_us_data.dat`.\n- **Giver:** Madam Zelda, 9000000136, Blackspore Swamp (wiki 3113 line 40: \"A Dark Future from Madam Zelda in Blackspore Swamp\"; wiki 3538 line 17).\n- **Offer (intro) text:**\n  - 432194: \"Hello there, traveler. I see a close encounter with the supernatural in your future. Close enough to really sink it's teeth in. Eee-he-he!<BR><BR>Don't worry. I'll tell you how to avoid disaster, but only if you bring me some <font color='#D9781A'>gassy water</font> from the swamp.\" (most likely the NPC's offer line; not confirmed as the offer)\n  - 432196: \"Madam Zelda is a Gypsy who can see things normal people can't. She will help you avoid pending disaster if you do some simple tasks for her. First, bring some gassy swamp water to her.\" (quest log description-style text)\n- **Description:** 432199: \"Madam Zelda claims that something terrible may befall you soon. Bring her some gassy water from the swamps and she'll help you out.\"\n- **Objective lines:**\n  - 432200: \"Find Gassy Water\"\n  - 432201: \"What makes the water gassy? Is it swamp gas?\" (dialogue, not clearly an objective)\n  - 432204: \"I need some of the swamp's gassy water. Why? My throat's parched!\" (dialogue)\n  - 432202: \"Return to Madam Zelda\" (return objective)\n- **Completion text (probable, not confirmed):** 432197: \"Excellent! My throat's been rather dry lately.<BR><BR>*chug*<BR>*chug*<BR>*BURP* Ooh, swamp gas!\" Its wording fits a reply to the water ",
