 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Dooba (Briarwood)\n\n## Dooba (npc 9000000308, name_string_id 37569): quest dossier\n\n**Summary.** Dooba's four Fisherman quests named in the record are already built, except one id mismatch. The only unbuilt quest I can tie to Dooba with direct evidence is **Grubby Hands** (original quest id 462). Dooba's Sasparilla Keg is a second candidate, but the evidence points to a different giver.\n\n### Already built (skip)\n- **Fisherman: Live Bait!** (title 412250 in the file, quest 3070027), **Fisherman: Taking the Bait** (3070028) and **Fisherman: A Gift For Estelle** (3070029). Giver 9000000308, built in `prototype/osfr-tools/data/content/quests/fisherman.json` at about lines 1324-1436. Their objectives and rewards are empty there.\n- **Fisherman: Dooba's Secret** (quest 3070026, title 409226, intro 409225, description 409227, end 409228). It is built at `fisherman.json` lines 1278-1323, but its giver is `9000000127`, not Dooba. Karl Kippersun is the pointer, per `notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Fisherman.md` row 22. Dooba's record `quest_ids_given` omits 3070026, though `quests_given_text` lists it. This is a data discrepancy to resolve, not a new quest.\n\n### 1. Grubby Hands (original quest id 462) — unbuilt, Dooba-given by wording\n\n- **Title:** \"Grubby Hands\", locale **37602**.\n- **Giver:** Dooba (9000000308). The intro and description are both in Dooba's voice or about him. No explicit giver field exists in the source. (R) giver = Dooba.\n- **Intro (offer), locale 38002:** \"Hey, you!  I'll never catch any fish without bait, and if I move from this spot the pixies will surely get their grubby hands on my sasparilla.  <BR><BR>Oh!  That gives me an idea.  Kick over some <font color='#d9781a'>mossy stones</font> and find some fishing grubs, would you?\"\n- **Description (journal), locale 37603:** \"Dooba can't catch fish without grubs and he can't leave his sasparilla unattended either.  Collect the grubs he needs from under nearby mossy stones.\"\n- **Objective:** locale **37604** \"Collect fishing grubs.\" Objective description, locale **116089**: \"Look under mossy stones in Nettleseed for fishing grubs.\" Required count **6** (`required_raw: 6`, progress 0). Objective id 3534.\n- **Steps, in order:**\n  1. Accept the quest from Dooba at the Nettleseed fishing hole (9000000308; the pond edge in Nettleseed per locale 38004).\n  2. Kick over the mossy stones in Nettleseed and collect 6 fishing grubs (objective 3534). The item id for the grubs is **unknown**.\n  3. Ret",
