  "intro_text_string_id": "locale:410031 \"You're not the only one who's come here complaining about my brother. He's never nice to the competition.<BR><BR>A <font color='#d9781A'>fishing tournament</font> is about to start at <font color='#d9781A'>Sacred Grove Shallows</font>. Ernest wouldn't miss it for the world.<BR><BR>Good luck setting him straight though. My brother is pretty thickheaded.\"",
