worms\"\n  - 92612: \"Look for areas not covered by snow\"\n  - 92613 (hash not checked): \"Return the worms to Big J\"\n  - 92615: \"Worms\" (tracker label; its use is unproven)\n- **Completion text:** not found. Locale ids 92602-92622 were probed; 92614, 92617, 92619, 92621 and 92623-92624 do not exist. 92620 is \"Max Rank Acquired\" and 92622 is \"Snobby Tourist\", both unrelated.\n\n**Steps (in order):**\n1. Accept the errand from Big J at the Ice Skating and Bait Shop, Snowhill (client 352146976, 1941898979).\n2. Search Snowhill for the escaped worms, in areas",
