ts as \"Clover (wiki). The client text reads as Gordon\". The client text points to Doctor Gordon (Gordon is 9000000023 in sanctuary.json:5567), and the wiki points to Clover (9000000052). The NPC record's `quest_ids_given` also omits 3090026. A builder should decide the giver; I did not change anything.\n- **A Strong Supplement (3090015):** no client title or text, so its intro, objective and completion text are unknown. Its only evidence is the wiki title and Medic.md row 15. Its reward is unknown.\n- **Rewards:** no quest in the build has an eviden",
