 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Postchug Runalug (Wugachug)\n\n# Postchug Runalug (npc 9000000172, Wugachug): unbuilt quests\n\nSummary: Five of the record's `quest_ids_given` are already built, so they are skipped. Two unbuilt quests have evidence: **A Missing Postchug** (strong) and **Delivery for Rimpadun** (weaker, with the giver taken from the guide). The text is the locale table's English, cited by row id. The guide's hash ids (ucdt/ugdt) are noted where they are the only link.\n\n## Already built (skipped)\n- Card Duelist: Parcel Recovery, id 3040021, `quests/card_duelist.json:1019`.\n- Postman: Jug Clean Up 3130020 (`quests/postman.json:998`), Postman: Sorting It Out 3130021 (`:1048`), Postman: Achieve Level 15 3130022 (`:1098`), Postman: Fair Warning 3130023 (`:1148`), all with giver 9000000172.\n- Postman: Where's the Sasparilla? is built as 3130019 (`postman.json:944`, title 130193). Its giver_npc_id is 9000000079, not Runalug, so the offer is Seaside's (Enve LeStamp per the Postman guide, row 16). Runalug only gives the PCA step (1317516993).\n\n## Quest 1: A Missing Postchug (unbuilt; strongest evidence)\n\n- **Title:** locale 46549 \"A Missing Postchug\". Hashes: ucdt 2294107554 (per the wugachug.json record), ugdt 509086726 (`refs: FreeRealmsLocaleTools/.../data/en_us_data.dat:13554`).\n- **Giver:** Postchug Runalug (npc 9000000172). Evidence is by wording, not a quest record. `npcs/wugachug.json:12174` lists it as `quest_id: null`, `page_lists`. The guide: `NPCs - Wugachug.md:151`.\n- **Intro (offer), locale 46548:** \"One of my postchugs was due back from Merry Vale hours ago! I hope nothing bad has happened! <BR><BR>Please go and find him, he should be on the road somewhere between here and Merry Vale.\"\n- **Objectives, in order:**\n  1. Locale 46550: \"Find the lost postchug. He is somewhere along the road between Wugachug and Merry Vale.\"\n  2. Locale 46557: \"Search for the lost postchug! He should be somewhere along the road between Wugachug and Merry Vale.\" (same step, other wording; the guide's hash 4280580861.)\n  3. Locale 46559: \"Find the missing postchug\" (objective title). Description, locale 46560: \"The missing postchug was delivering a shipment of sasparilla to Merry Vale. Search for him along the road from Wugachug to Merry Vale.\"\n  4. Locale 46562: \"Return to Postchug Runalug in Wugachug\" (objective title).\n  5. Locale 46563: \"Return to Postchug Runalug in Wugachug and tell him what happened to his missing postchug.\" (guide hash 2688819018.)\n- **Target:** the missing",
