 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Manager Landon (Snowhill)\n\n## Summary\n\nManager Landon (npc 9000000140, ucdt 2754079242) has one quest with evidence that he gives it: **Soccer Star: Meeting The Team (3140005)**. It is already in `prototype/osfr-tools/data/content/quests/soccer_star.json` (lines 177-222) as a skeleton. It has the title, giver and intro/description/end text ids, but `objectives` and `rewards` are empty and `enabled` is false. No unbuilt quest with Landon as giver is evidenced, so nothing new is dossiered as a build candidate. The fill-in facts for 3140005 are below.\n\n## Quests Landon gives: status\n\n| Quest id | Title (locale id) | Giver in quests file | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 3140005 | Soccer Star: Meeting The Team (402574) | 9000000140 (Landon) | Built as skeleton (`soccer_star.json:177-222`), not enabled, no objectives or rewards |\n| 3140001 | Become a Soccer Star (412463) | 9000000547 (unresolved; guide says giver unknown, target Landon) | Built as skeleton, giver unknown |\n| 3140002 | Being a Better Soccer Star (442276) | 9000000548 (unresolved; guide says giver unknown, target Landon) | Built as skeleton, giver unknown |\n| 3140004 | Soccer Star: Snowy Scrimmage (407408) | 9000000003 (unnamed speaker) | Built as skeleton; Landon is not its giver in any source |\n\n## 3140005: Soccer Star: Meeting The Team (already built as skeleton; fill-in evidence)\n\n- **Title:** \"Soccer Star: Meeting The Team\" (locale 402574). Guide title ids: 2283833823 ucdt; 3652384693 ugdt (`notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Soccer Star.md`, Arc 1 row 2). Locale 402678 \"Meeting The Team\" is the bare title.\n- **Giver:** Manager Landon. Guide cites 4140297596 and 781135410 (Soccer Star.md Arc 1 row 2).\n- **Location:** Snowhill, then the Sidekicks' camp in the North Wilds.\n- **Intro (offer), locale 402573:** \"Since you're about to go introduce yourself to the Sidekicks, could you do me a favor? I got a couple extra jerseys for them, so could you make a delivery to everyone? I think it's a good icebreaker. Go meet your teammates and Coach \"Golden Leg\" Eddie. He used to be quite famous, you know.\"\n- **Objective line, locale 402679:** \"Manager Landon wants you to deliver jerseys to the Sidekicks at North Wilds.\"\n- **Description, locale 402575:** \"Manager Landon wants you to deliver extra jerseys to the Northern Wild's Sidekicks. It's a good opportunity to meet the team and your new coach. You should have a bright future as a soccer star with them!\"\n- **Completion (end text), locale 402576:*",
