 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Tumbolina (Merry Vale)\n\n## Tumbolina (npc 9000000222, Merry Vale): no unbuilt quests\n\nEvery quest I can evidence as given by Tumbolina is already built in `prototype/osfr-tools/data/content/quests/warrior.json`. No new dossier is needed.\n\n### Quests given by Tumbolina (giver_npc_id 9000000222)\n\n| Quest id | Title (locale id) | Built at | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 3150008 | Warrior: Distracted (71036) | warrior.json:469-520 | built, `enabled: false` |\n| 3150009 | Warrior: Too Distracted to Work (71233) | warrior.json:521-572 | built, `enabled: false` |\n\nThe only repo quests with giver 9000000222 are these two (`grep 9000000222` over quests/ returns lines 472 and 524).\n\n- **3150008 \"Warrior: Distracted\"**: intro 71035, description 71037, end text 71038, prerequisite 3150007. Evidence: `notes/Build Guides/Content/Jobs/Warrior.md` row W8; `npcs/merry_vale.json:30887` (intro line 71035 spoken by Tumbolina); `T316.md:93`. Locale 71037: \"Tumbolina thinks she can fix the weapons if you get her tools back from Braldan Stoneaxe in Merry Vale.\"\n- **3150009 \"Warrior: Too Distracted to Work\"**: intro 71232, description 71234, end text 71235, prerequisite 3150008. Evidence: Warrior.md row W9; locale 71234: \"Tumbolina doesn't want to leave Merry Vale, and has asked you to convince her ex-business partner, Aster…\" (the description, which is where the record's 857744776 comes from); locale 71228 is the crate-in-Den-of-Secrets step text.\n\n### Items in the record that are not Tumbolina-given quests\n\n- **Warrior: You Deserve Better** (3150007, title 70995): giver is Steele (9000000208). Tumbolina is only the weapon-pickup target. Already built in warrior.json:417-468.\n- **Warrior: Knocking Some Sense In** (3150012, title 71265): giver is Aster (9000000243). Built in warrior.json:675. Tumbolina only sends the player to Aster (857744776).\n- **Test on Tumbolina** (934442070): a Cudip \"Potion Testing: Version 7.0\" target, not a Tumbolina quest (`NPCs - Merry Vale.md` row for Potion Testing).\n- **Cotton-candy hand-ins** (4129793011): part of the cotton-candy errand chain (Rimpadun's Plan), not a Tumbolina quest.\n- **\"Speak with Tumbolina\" (71001)**: belongs to Dubawug's Birthday Surprises chain (3076, `refs:Lxzxrus-Free-Realms-Server/src/Resources/Quests.json:911-935`, giver GUID 100000002271 = Dubawug), not to Tumbolina.\n\n### Gaps\n\n- Warrior quests 3150008 and 3150009 have no reward data and no objective data in warrior.json (rewards and objectives empty, `(R)` on ",
